flowchart LR
    SRC[ICT / FCT / Depanel / other source station] -->|NG event + evidence| MES[MES NG registry and route engine]
    MES -->|versioned work order| RS[Repair station agent]
    RS -->|scan + custody| BUCKET[QR bucket / handover]
    BUCKET --> PDA[Team or line leader PDA]
    RS -->|materials| WMS[WMS]
    RS -->|quality evidence| QMS[QMS / QC]
    RS -->|heartbeat, facts, retest request| MES
    RS -->|pickup announcement| KANBAN[MES Kanban / Andon]
    PDA -->|acknowledge pickup and receive| MES
    RS -->|authorized return handover| RETURN[Target source station]
    RETURN -->|retest result| MES
    MES -->|close, repeat, escalate, scrap or replace| CASE[Repair case lifecycle]
    RS -. offline append-only .-> OUTBOX[Local SQLite Outbox]
    OUTBOX -. idempotent replay .-> MES
